 curves <- survfit(fit, newdata=temp)

I think these could be combined (because survift cannont yet work with 
survReg), but wonder what anyone else might do to display the results of 
complicated survival analyses. And what might be appropriate for factor 
covariate interactions?

Thanks to anyone willing to take the time on this one.
andrew

