Thanks to Remy van de Ven for his helpful response.  His suggestion to my
original query is exactly what I was looking for!  The trick is to set the
option keep.order=T in the function terms().
    fit <- aov(terms(Y ~ A*B + X, keep.order=T))
    anova(fit)
My original query and my initial (hasty) summary are below.

